---
import Icons from './Icons.astro';
import { COMMUNITY } from '../data/community';
---

<section id="comunidad" class="py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Telegram Primary Spotlight (8 cols) -->
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#229ED9]/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0A1935] via-[#0B1328] to-[#080E1D] p-7 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-8">
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#229ED9]/20 blur-3xl"
        ></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-8">
          <div>
            <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#229ED9]/15 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-[#38BDF8] ring-1 ring-[#229ED9]/35">
              <Icons name="telegram" class="h-4 w-4" />
              <span>Nuestro espacio principal · {COMMUNITY.telegramHandle}</span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
              La conversación pasa todos los días en Telegram.
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
              No hace falta esperar a un evento para aprender o conversar. En nuestro grupo se habla de todo en tecnología: desde Linux y distintos sistemas operativos hasta herramientas Open Source, programación, redes, hardware y crecimiento profesional.
            </p>

            <!-- Topic Pills inside Telegram -->
            <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              {['Open Source & Software Libre', 'Linux y Sistemas Operativos', 'Tecnología en General', 'Dudas, Ideas y Carrera IT'].map((topic) => (
                <span class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-slate-200">
                  # {topic}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#229ED9]/20 text-[#38BDF8]">
                <Icons name="users" class="h-4 w-4" />
              </span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-white">{COMMUNITY.telegramMembers} miembros activos</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Acceso abierto · Sin spam</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a
              href={COMMUNITY.telegramUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#229ED9] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-[#229ED9]/25 transition hover:bg-[#1b8cc2]"
            >
              <Icons name="telegram" class="h-4 w-4" />
              <span>Unirme ahora a t.me/foss_rd</span>
              <Icons name="external" class="h-4 w-4 opacity-80" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- GitHub Secondary Spotlight (4 cols) -->
      <div class="card-glass relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-4">
        <div
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-16 -right-16 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-[#CE1126]/20 blur-3xl"
        ></div>

        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#CE1126]/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-[#ff6b7d] ring-1 ring-[#CE1126]/35">
            <Icons name="github" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
            <span>Código abierto</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            Construye en público con FOSSRD
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            Explora configuraciones de sistemas, herramientas y proyectos abiertos publicados por miembros para aprender, hacer fork o enviar tu primer Pull Request.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 space-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <span>Organización</span>
            <span class="text-slate-200">@FOSSRD</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href={COMMUNITY.githubUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.05] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-[#CE1126]/60 hover:bg-white/[0.1]"
          >
            <Icons name="github" class="h-4 w-4" />
            <span>Explorar github.com/FOSSRD</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
